This project reuses material from Morse Learn by Ace Centre
(https://github.com/AceCentre/morse-learn, Apache-2.0), itself a fork of the
Morse code experiment by Google Creative Lab with Tania Finlayson
(https://github.com/googlecreativelab/morse-learn). Copyright 2018 Google Inc.;
portions copyright Ace Centre.

Reused and adapted:
- The International Morse code letter mapping from scripts/morse-dictionary.js
  (now src/lib/protocol/morse.ts).
- The teaching approach of introducing letters progressively while continuing
  to practise previously introduced letters (re-implemented here as a fixed,
  non-adaptive schedule; no source code of the game engine is included).

Not reused: the Phaser game, keyboard/switch input, recorded mp3 audio,
picture and sound-alike mnemonics, adaptive progression and analytics service.
